			<item>
				<title>About Coco&#39;s Canines</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/about/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/about/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;our-story&#34;&gt;Our Story&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Coco&amp;rsquo;s Canines was founded by Nicole LaCount, who has spent over a decade caring for dogs in the Arlington/Marysville area. What started as a passion became a calling — Nicole volunteers at local animal shelters and has fostered and adopted numerous dogs.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;We recently moved to a beautiful new property in Arlington with plenty of room for dogs to run and play in the Pacific Northwest. Our home-based setting means your dog stays in a real home environment, not a commercial kennel.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Contact</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/contact/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/contact/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;We&amp;rsquo;d love to meet your dog! Fill out the form below and we&amp;rsquo;ll get back to you within 24 hours to schedule a meet &amp;amp; greet.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;contact-layout&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;form class=&#34;contact-form&#34; action=&#34;https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID&#34; method=&#34;POST&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;name&#34;&gt;Your Name *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;name&#34; name=&#34;name&#34; required&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;email&#34;&gt;Your Email *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;email&#34; id=&#34;email&#34; name=&#34;email&#34; required&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;dog-name&#34;&gt;Dog&#39;s Name *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; id=&#34;dog-name&#34; name=&#34;dog_name&#34; required&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;service&#34;&gt;Service Interest *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;select id=&#34;service&#34; name=&#34;service&#34; required&gt;&#xA;        &lt;option value=&#34;&#34;&gt;Select a service...&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;        &lt;option value=&#34;daycare&#34;&gt;Daycare&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;        &lt;option value=&#34;boarding&#34;&gt;Boarding&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;        &lt;option value=&#34;walking&#34;&gt;Walking&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;        &lt;option value=&#34;other&#34;&gt;Other / Not Sure&lt;/option&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/select&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;form-group&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;label for=&#34;message&#34;&gt;Message *&lt;/label&gt;&#xA;      &lt;textarea id=&#34;message&#34; name=&#34;message&#34; rows=&#34;5&#34; required&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;input type=&#34;text&#34; name=&#34;_gotcha&#34; style=&#34;display:none&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;button type=&#34;submit&#34; class=&#34;btn&#34;&gt;Send Message&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/form&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;contact-info&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;h3&gt;Business Information&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;contact-info-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;strong&gt;Location&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;Arlington / Marysville, WA&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;contact-info-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;strong&gt;Daycare Hours&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;Monday–Friday, 7am–6pm&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;contact-info-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;strong&gt;Boarding Hours&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;Drop-off by 5pm, pickup by 5pm next day&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &#xA;    &lt;div class=&#34;contact-info-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;strong&gt;Follow Us&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;      &lt;p&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.instagram.com/cocoscanines/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;        &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.facebook.com/cocoscanines/&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;Facebook&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/p&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Gallery</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/gallery/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/gallery/</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;Browse photos of the happy pups who visit Coco&amp;rsquo;s Canines. From playful daycare sessions to peaceful boarding stays, see why dogs love our home-based care.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;gallery-grid&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-01.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Happy dog playing at daycare&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-02.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dog enjoying outdoor play&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-03.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dogs playing together&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-04.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dog on a walk&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-05.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dog resting at daycare&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-06.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Happy dog at boarding&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-07.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dog playing fetch&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-08.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dogs socializing&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-09.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dog enjoying treats&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&#34;gallery-item&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/images/gallery-10.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;Dog at Coco&#39;s Canines&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Want to see more? Follow us on &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.instagram.com/cocoscanines/&#34;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt; for daily updates and photos!&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
			<item>
				<title>Services</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/services/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/cocoscanines/services/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;daycare&#34;&gt;Daycare&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Full-day supervised play in our home environment. We cater to each individual dog&amp;rsquo;s needs with socialization, exercise, and plenty of love.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hours:&lt;/strong&gt; Monday–Friday, 7am–6pm&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What to expect:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Supervised group play with compatible dogs&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Individual attention and care&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Indoor and outdoor play areas&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Rest periods throughout the day&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Daily updates for pet parents&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;boarding&#34;&gt;Boarding&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Overnight stays in our home, not a kennel. Your dog gets daily walks, individual attention, and a report card so you never miss a moment.&#xA;&lt;strong&gt;Hours:&lt;/strong&gt; Drop-off by 5pm, pickup by 5pm next day&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
